    Staff – exhibition details (/staff/exhibitions/{id}, SCR-29): information, status, artworks by status.
    The markup is shared with the other area (Views/Shared/Exhibitions/_ExhibitionDetails.cshtml).
    Minimal version created by BE2-09; FE2 builds the real design in FE2-07.
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = Model.Name;
